{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/dome.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/dome.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "dome_coast_square_npc_01",
      "hash64": "919D49A134197953",
      "text": "紫竽前辈会很亲切地\\n教别人宝可梦的知识哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "dome_coast_square_npc_02",
      "hash64": "919D4AA134197B06",
      "text": "紫竽每天会用宝可梦洗澡澡\\n给宝可梦洗上足足３次澡哦。\\r\\n所以她的宝可梦总是很干净。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "dome_coast_square_npc_12",
      "hash64": "91A0CCA1341C8DC3",
      "text": "不管龙属性多么强，\\n在妖精的力量前都不堪一击！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "dome_coast_square_npc_13",
      "hash64": "91A0CBA1341C8C10",
      "text": "据说紫竽明明\\n在属性上有优势，\\r\\n但却没打赢过杜若。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "dome_coast_beach_npc_12",
      "hash64": "88589670E382166F",
      "text": "海岸区的魅力在于海！\\n用的可是真正的海水哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "dome_coast_area3_npc_03",
      "hash64": "2339F558CE3104CA",
      "text": "巨蛋的休息站中\\n有自动售货机哦！\\r\\n在那能买到各种球！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "dome_coast_area3_npc_04",
      "hash64": "2339F058CE30FC4B",
      "text": "用潜水球能够更容易地\\n捉住在游泳的宝可梦哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "dome_savanna_square_npc_01",
      "hash64": "C4AA338B4EC31E19",
      "text": "那些堆砌着方块的地方，\\n小的叫休息站！\\r\\n而大的则叫广场哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "dome_savanna_square_npc_02",
      "hash64": "C4AA308B4EC31900",
      "text": "赤松的料理可厉害了！\\n他会用鸭嘴炎兽的火烤食材！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "dome_savanna_square_npc_04",
      "hash64": "C4AA368B4EC32332",
      "text": "火属性的宝可梦\\n不会陷入灼伤状态！\\r\\n知道这点便能领先别人一步！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "dome_savanna_battlecourt_npc_03",
      "hash64": "6E3D73FB10921FD5",
      "text": "草原区有斑斑马，\\n所以超棒的！\\c\\n当你跨越区域，\\n能遇到的宝可梦就会改变哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "dome_savanna_battlecourt_npc_05",
      "hash64": "6E3D6DFB109215A3",
      "text": "四天王战会在各广场里的\\n对战场上举行哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "dome_savanna_battlecourt_npc_06",
      "hash64": "6E3D6EFB10921756",
      "text": "在蓝莓联盟排名不够高的话，\\n甚至都不能挑战四天王哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "dome_savanna_area3_npc_01",
      "hash64": "BEB0C2002490414E",
      "text": "大颚蚁进化后，\\n会增加龙属性哦～\\r\\n为什么呢？真不可思议～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "dome_savanna_area3_npc_03",
      "hash64": "BEB0C00024903DE8",
      "text": "在使用回复机时如果后面有人，\\n我就会紧张起来……！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "dome_canyon_square_npc_01",
      "hash64": "FDA6CE47964390E3",
      "text": "纳莉她酷酷的，超迷人！\\n她不但是学生会长，还是四天王！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "dome_canyon_square_npc_02",
      "hash64": "FDA6CF4796439296",
      "text": "在峡谷区有很多\\n粗犷的宝可梦！\\c\\n四天王纳莉也会\\n派出钢宝可梦哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "dome_canyon_square_npc_03",
      "hash64": "FDA6D04796439449",
      "text": "叫做盔甲鸟的宝可梦\\n弱点很少，很难对付哦！\\c\\n在生态巨蛋中，它还会化身\\n飞翔出租车大显身手！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "dome_canyon_area2_npc_04",
      "hash64": "0699A1637EA167A2",
      "text": "在某个地区似乎存在着\\n钢铠鸦的天敌。\\c\\n想必是一种\\n样子很可怕的宝可梦吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "dome_canyon_area2_npc_05",
      "hash64": "0699A2637EA16955",
      "text": "因为对钢铠鸦的喜爱，\\n让我和他变得很要好！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "dome_canyon_area2_npc_07",
      "hash64": "0699A0637EA165EF",
      "text": "用喇叭啄鸟挑战飞翔计时赛\\n实在是有点鲁莽啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "dome_canyon_area4_npc_07",
      "hash64": "4A80FA9D5988053D",
      "text": "这里是电气石岩窟！\\n如果带电的话就会酥酥麻麻的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "dome_polar_square_npc_02",
      "hash64": "F5876F74DEE785DC",
      "text": "杜若是２年级学生……\\n咦？\\c\\n去年跟前年，\\n他好像也是２年级学生……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "dome_polar_area2_npc_01",
      "hash64": "EFE54481364A2A9F",
      "text": "极地区里栖息着\\n抗寒能力很强的宝可梦哦。\\r\\n感觉当中大多是冰属性的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_01",
      "hash64": "7010503B493C631A",
      "text": "这前面是峡谷区！\\n那里的岩石表面坑坑洼洼的，\\r\\n所以建议你骑上坐骑宝可梦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_05",
      "hash64": "70104C3B493C5C4E",
      "text": "据说和大家一起进行蓝乐活的话，\\n获得的报酬会增加哦！\\r\\n虽然我没有朋友一起进行蓝乐活……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_07",
      "hash64": "70104A3B493C58E8",
      "text": "这里是中心广场！\\n是４个区域交接的地方！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_14_01",
      "hash64": "F3FAEAFDD69B1F9A",
      "text": "最近联盟社里的\\n氛围有点差……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_15_01",
      "hash64": "C97CD7092003AD4F",
      "text": "自从乌栗取代杜若\\n成了冠军之后……\\r\\n社团活动就变得不快乐了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_14_02",
      "hash64": "F3FAE9FDD69B1DE7",
      "text": "虽然这样说不太好，\\n但我早就希望乌栗放弃当冠军了。\\r\\n所以现在很开心。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_15_02",
      "hash64": "C97CD8092003AF02",
      "text": "听说新的冠军\\n不是学园里的人！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_14_03",
      "hash64": "F3FAE8FDD69B1C34",
      "text": "能开心进行对战的\\n联盟社复活了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_15_03",
      "hash64": "C97CD9092003B0B5",
      "text": "现在的社团活动，\\n我有动力加油！\\r\\n争取当个四天王什么的吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_16",
      "hash64": "700CC93B493947DE",
      "text": "巨蛋中的方块\\n会发射出红外线和紫外线！\\c\\n……据说会促进\\n宝可梦和植物的成长！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_21",
      "hash64": "7016BC3B4941864C",
      "text": "那边是极地区！\\c\\n因为那里有通过人工\\n重现出的冰山，所以很冷哦～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_35",
      "hash64": "7013BC3B493F5075",
      "text": "团体战之类的任务，\\n和大家一起做的话就能轻松完成！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_36",
      "hash64": "7013B93B493F4B5C",
      "text": "我要和哥哥\\n一起进行蓝乐活～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_40_01",
      "hash64": "A5C7FEAD8569F2A5",
      "text": "１年级那个叫乌栗的孩子，\\n给人的感觉突然变了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_40_02",
      "hash64": "A5C7FBAD8569ED8C",
      "text": "冠军战打得太精彩了。\\n相信乌栗很不甘心吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_40_03",
      "hash64": "A5C7FCAD8569EF3F",
      "text": "据说乌栗休学了，\\n希望他能早日振作起来。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_48",
      "hash64": "7002C13B4930E5C1",
      "text": "只有优秀的学生！\\n能收到太晶珠。\\r\\n……据说那材料很贵重！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_49",
      "hash64": "7002C03B4930E40E",
      "text": "太晶化真是深奥！\\n有时还会增加弱点！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_50",
      "hash64": "6FFF333B492DBEA0",
      "text": "那边是海岸区！\\n有花有海，如同身在阿罗拉！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_54",
      "hash64": "6FFF373B492DC56C",
      "text": "咦？莫非……\\n方块的颜色会根据区域而不同？",
